-*- mode: org -*-

PariDroid provides [[http://pari.math.u-bordeaux.fr/][Pari/GP]] for the Android system.


* Building and installing PariDroid

Prebuilt binaries are available through the
[[https://f-droid.org/][F-Droid]] and Google Play app stores,
as well as on the
[[https://pari.math.u-bordeaux.fr/download.html#paridroid][PARI/GP web site]].

The process by which the binaries are built, including installation
instructions for the build environment, is also
[[https://pari.math.u-bordeaux.fr/paridroid/index.html][available online]].

